1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,715
Four common formats.

2
00:00:01,715 --> 00:00:04,972
B M P: uncompressed, very large files.

3
00:00:04,972 --> 00:00:08,573
J P G: lossy compression, good for photos.

4
00:00:08,573 --> 00:00:12,945
P N G: lossless compression, supports transparency.

5
00:00:12,945 --> 00:00:19,632
G I F: two hundred and fifty-six colours, supports animation and transparency.

